EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} sent you to find me?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}So much intrigue and excitement!
Lead the way, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}avevi un altro impegno?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Sembri avere una fretta assurda...{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
No, no!
Sì, devo fare presto...

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aspetta un secondo!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Secondo me
il tuo orientamento non è affidabile.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Non è la strada giusta!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Ooops! Hai ragione!
Andiamo di qua...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Hey! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}You know we're supposed to
be going to {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}'s house,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
right?{{TAG:000F:0000:15000000}}
Silly me!
Sorry—I've gotta go!

IT:
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} vuole vedermi? {{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ma dai! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Beh, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}in questo momento
sono, tipo, superimpegnatissima...
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Magari puoi ricordarmelo più tardi,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
quando avrò meno pensieri che
mi frullano in testa!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Grazie una cifra per{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} avermelo detto.
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}È stato{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} carinissimo da parte tua,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
